  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Coconut_Tree?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/41/Coconut_Tree.png/revision/latest?cb=20260401002151\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Coconut tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coconut tree\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"316\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Coconut tree</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/trees-and-bushes-7454\" title=\"Trees and Bushes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Trees &amp; bushes</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 101</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 810</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gives </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Coconut</span><span title=\"Coconut(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/coconut-35552\" title=\"Coconut\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coconut\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2f/Coconut.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20240219032853\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  every 1 d 12 h</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 21</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 19</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Coconut trees</b> are a type of <a href=\"/wiki/trees-and-bushes-7454\" title=\"Trees and Bushes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tree</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 101.\n</p><p>Each tree can give up to 13 <a href=\"/wiki/coconut-35552\" title=\"Coconut\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Coconuts</a>, which are collected over 4 harvests.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Stages</b></span></h3>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/26/Coconut_Tree_Stage_1.png/revision/latest?cb=20260530003902\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coconut Tree Stage 1\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"110\" height=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/0c/Coconut_Tree_Stage_2.png/revision/latest?cb=20260530004020\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coconut Tree Stage 2\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"129\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/41/Coconut_Tree.png/revision/latest?cb=20260401002151\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coconut Tree\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"158\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6c/Coconut_Tree_Dead.png/revision/latest?cb=20260530003621\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coconut Tree Dead\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"142\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Stage 1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>Stage 2</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>Ready</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>Dead</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying</b></span></h3>\n<p><span>Shop</span><span title=\"Shop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"43\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> Coconut trees can be purchased in the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a> for 810 <a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">coins</a> each.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Harvesting</b></span></h3>\n<p>The time between harvests is 1 day and 12 hours for each tree. Each harvest yields additional coconuts:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/3b/Coconut_Tree_Harvest_2.png/revision/latest?cb=20260530004649\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coconut Tree Harvest 2\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/cc/Coconut_Tree_Harvest_3.png/revision/latest?cb=20260530004720\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coconut Tree Harvest 3\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"129\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/41/Coconut_Tree.png/revision/latest?cb=20260401002151\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coconut Tree\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"158\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>2 coconuts</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>3 coconuts</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>4 coconuts</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Revival</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/63/Coconut_Tree_Revival.png/revision/latest?cb=20260401000253\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Coconut tree up for revival\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coconut tree up for revival\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"332\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Coconut tree up for revival</figcaption></figure>\n<p>After the third harvest the tree wilts. A player can ask for another player to revive it by tapping on it and placing a sign on the tree. When another player revives it a final harvest of four coconuts can be collected before the tree dies.  The helper gets 21 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> points by reviving a coconut tree.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Removing</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/0a/Saw.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130211\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Saw\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>A <a href=\"/wiki/saw-2924\" title=\"Saw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">saw</a> is needed to remove a dead tree from the farm. Note that players may also use a saw to remove the tree after the third harvest instead of placing it up for revival.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\">Did you know?</span></h2>\n<p>Before the coconut tree was introduced, the <a href=\"/wiki/cacao-tree-2607\" title=\"Cacao Tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cacao</a> along with the <a href=\"/wiki/blueberry-bush-36309\" title=\"Blueberry Bush\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">blueberry bush</a> (which appeared in a later update) had the most harvest time, which was 35 hours (1d 11h). \n</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/apple-tree-2603\" title=\"Apple Tree (68 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/bb/Apple_Tree.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191028165803\" title=\"Apple Tree (68 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Apple Tree (68 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/banana-tree-26403\" title=\"Banana Tree (210 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/eb/Banana_Tree.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250301115943\" title=\"Banana Tree (210 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Banana Tree (210 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div cla